Maple Tree Farms is a green grocer in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], the nearest one to the [[Sin and Tonic]]. The party bought tinfoil and eggs there on the way back from the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Diamond District/index|Diamond District]].
